      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can you introduce an enum as return status? I would like\n- !state\n- state-\u003edrbg_entropy_size !\u003d sizeof(state-\u003edrbg_entropy)\n- else\n\nbe distinguished, rather than just a boolean. Note that for (!state) we don\u0027t have to call FIPS_ON command.",
