      "writtenOn": "2023-12-13T02:58:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see, u2f_get_state() creates the state if not created yet. So on a device with state not created yet, calling this command will actually create the state with FIPS path, and returning true. This is fine to me.",
